WEBVTT

00:03:58.974 --> 00:04:00.871
Hurricanes get more intense.

00:04:00.895 --> 00:04:04.295
Scientists release yet another
doom-filled report.

00:04:04.734 --> 00:04:07.608
Politicians push back even more strongly,

00:04:07.632 --> 00:04:10.391
repeating the same
sciencey-sounding myths.

00:04:11.885 --> 00:04:14.527
What can we do to break
this vicious cycle?

00:04:15.085 --> 00:04:19.334
The number one thing we can do
is the exact thing that we're not doing:

00:04:20.307 --> 00:04:21.457
talk about it.

00:04:22.851 --> 00:04:24.779
But you might say, "I'm not a scientist.

00:04:24.803 --> 00:04:27.168
How am I supposed to talk
about radiative forcing

00:04:27.192 --> 00:04:30.128
or cloud parametrization
in climate models?"